1.10.1: the calibrator's verdict - MOTION=2 becomes the default

Bracketed on real still footage, motion-scale 2 was judged right; the
super8 and polavision presets absorb it (weave 0.0170 / 0.0160, flicker
0.140 / 0.170), so scale 1 now means the approved look. Autochrome and
technicolor keep their own characters pending their own field tests;
--motion-scale / MOTION= remain for taste and for tripod-locked or
worn-projector deviations.
